[5:10p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is quite slow underneath the Oshodi bridge inwards Brown junction due to high influx and full-fledged commercial activities.

Moving on to Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD approaching Airport is good.

A bit slow inwards National and via the Ikeja Overpass, then better to Ajayi Farm and Ile-Zik.

