[5:20p.m.] #LagosAbeokutaExpress #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is good leaving Ile-Zik to Mangoro, Cement approaching Saw Mill where it gets a bit slow inwards Dopemu underneath the bridge due to high influx of vehicles funneling through the bus stop and commercial activities coupled with pedestrian crossing.

Moving on to Pako, Go-Ye, Adealu is all good, then a bit slow approaching GIG Transport company and the Iyana Ipaja underneath the bridge due to high influx, commercial activities, coupled with pedestrian crossing.

Our men are on hand to ensure traffic is unhindered.

